@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About Us";
}

<div class="page-header-block">
    <h1>About Sni's Driving School</h1>
    <p>Helping learners become safe, confident drivers since 2013.</p>
</div>

<div class="about-content">
    <div class="about-content-row">
        <div class="about-content-text">
            <h2>Our Story</h2>
            <p>
                Sni's Driving School was founded in 2013 with one simple goal: make learning to drive
                straightforward, affordable, and genuinely stress-free. What started as a single instructor
                and one car has grown into a full team of qualified instructors, a modern fleet of
                dual-control vehicles, and an easy-to-use online booking system — all without losing the
                personal, patient approach we started with.
            </p>
            <p>
                Today we've helped thousands of learners — nervous first-timers, busy professionals, and
                returning drivers alike — get safely and confidently onto the road.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content-image">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1722358309266-119271d5924a?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Open highway view from a car" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content-row reverse">
        <div class="about-content-text">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>
                We believe every learner deserves an instructor who is patient, encouraging, and genuinely
                invested in their progress. Our mission is to build safe, self-assured drivers — not just
                students who can pass a test, but drivers who are ready for real roads, real traffic, and
                real decisions behind the wheel.
            </p>
            <ul class="about-list">
                <li>Structured, easy-to-follow lesson plans for every skill level</li>
                <li>Fully licensed, DEKRA-accredited instructors</li>
                <li>Modern, dual-control, regularly serviced vehicles</li>
                <li>Flexible online booking that fits your schedule</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content-image">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1727893512947-8bdc773ceb02?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Handing over car keys after a successful lesson" />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section-block alt-bg">
    <h2 class="section-title">Meet Our Instructors</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Every instructor is fully licensed, background-checked, and trained to teach with patience.</p>

    <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-avatar">SN</div>
            <h3>Sni Nkosi</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Founder &amp; Head Instructor</p>
            <p>12+ years of teaching experience. Specialises in nervous first-time drivers and defensive driving.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-avatar">TM</div>
            <h3>Thabo Mahlangu</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Senior Instructor</p>
            <p>Focuses on test preparation and mock assessments, with a track record of first-attempt passes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-avatar">LP</div>
            <h3>Lerato Phiri</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Instructor</p>
            <p>Specialises in highway driving, night driving, and building confidence in busy traffic.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
            <div class="team-avatar">JD</div>
            <h3>Jason Dlamini</h3>
            <p class="team-role">Instructor</p>
            <p>Works closely with returning drivers who need a refresher after time away from the road.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section-block">
    <h2 class="section-title">Certifications &amp; Accreditation</h2>
    <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-item">
            <h4>DEKRA Accredited</h4>
            <p>All instructors are accredited driving instructors, meeting national training and safety standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
            <h4>Fully Insured Vehicles</h4>
            <p>Every training vehicle is comprehensively insured and fitted with dual controls for your safety.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
            <h4>Regular Vehicle Servicing</h4>
            <p>Our fleet is serviced on a strict schedule to keep every lesson safe and reliable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
            <h4>Background-Checked Staff</h4>
            <p>All instructors and staff undergo background checks before joining our team.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
